From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gardn maintainers <maintainers@masakiro.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] default lib-vt panes to grapheme clustering

Gardn renders libghostty-vt cells directly and requires DEC mode 2027
to store multi-codepoint grapheme clusters in one terminal cell. Set it in the
terminal's default modes so RIS restores clustering instead of disabling it.

Upstream issue: https://github.com/ogulcancelik/herdr/issues/243
Vendored base: 5834a0e3df621802e9578e4562d88b0c2ad4ada8
---
diff --git a/apps/gardn/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig b/apps/gardn/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/apps/gardn/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig
+++ b/apps/gardn/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig
@@ -826,9 +826,10 @@ fn new_(
     t.* = try .init(
         io.io(),
         alloc,
         .{
             .cols = cols,
             .rows = rows,
+            .default_modes = .{ .grapheme_cluster = true },
         },
     );
     errdefer t.deinit(alloc);
